WEBVTT

00:00:07.014 --> 00:00:08.344
Naomi, what's the situation?

00:00:08.614 --> 00:00:10.614
No ECM reaction.

00:00:10.614 --> 00:00:12.554
Okay, charge in there!

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:12.884
Yes, sir!

00:00:16.924 --> 00:00:19.014
Hold it right there, you criminals!

00:00:20.764 --> 00:00:23.224
I can see where you're hiding!

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:28.524
Take this!

00:00:38.144 --> 00:00:39.114
You won't escape!

00:00:42.014 --> 00:00:43.214
What's that noise?

00:00:44.554 --> 00:00:46.044
What's going on?

00:00:51.224 --> 00:00:53.384
All right, all right! We surrender!

00:00:59.604 --> 00:01:00.964
Mission, accomplished.

00:01:01.064 --> 00:01:02.004
Darn it!

00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:03.304
We can't do this!

00:01:03.304 --> 00:01:05.564
Why do we have to play the criminals?

00:01:05.704 --> 00:01:09.314
Understanding the criminal's
thoughts is part of the training!

00:01:09.314 --> 00:01:12.334
Besides, you all learned quite a bit, didn't you?

00:01:13.614 --> 00:01:16.654
About Naomi's beauty, wisdom, and superiority!

00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:20.014
Yes! You all are like fairies who live in that lake!

00:01:20.854 --> 00:01:22.444
I'm flying, I'm flying!

00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:26.394
Find any fairies in the lake?

00:01:27.224 --> 00:01:31.364
Dammit, Minamoto said he had
important duty today, but...

00:01:31.364 --> 00:01:32.734
Wanna go spy on him?

00:01:32.964 --> 00:01:36.534
We can't! He said we were to
absolutely stay away from him!

00:01:36.534 --> 00:01:39.004
Saying no just makes you
even more curious, right?

00:01:39.004 --> 00:01:40.604
Exactly!

00:01:40.604 --> 00:01:41.904
I wonder what he's doing.

00:01:43.514 --> 00:01:50.614
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:01:51.614 --> 00:01:57.484
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:59.924 --> 00:02:05.724
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:02:06.064 --> 00:02:10.934
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:02:12.204 --> 00:02:17.734
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:02:18.144 --> 00:02:22.744
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:02:23.354 --> 00:02:26.254
Limiter (changing myself)

00:02:26.254 --> 00:02:29.384
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:02:29.524 --> 00:02:35.254
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:02:36.694 --> 00:02:39.264
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:02:39.264 --> 00:02:42.094
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:48.504
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:02:48.644 --> 00:02:51.444
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:02:51.444 --> 00:02:54.084
Sora e karitateru yo

00:02:54.084 --> 00:02:59.814
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:03:00.154 --> 00:03:05.684
Zettai karen my wings

00:03:13.664 --> 00:03:14.804
Is there something here for us at
the special research facility?

00:03:14.804 --> 00:03:16.304
28th sense: "A Lady's Special Charms!
Tsubomi Kiss Alert"
Is there something here for us at
the special research facility?

00:03:16.304 --> 00:03:17.834
28th sense: "A Lady's Special Charms!
Tsubomi Kiss Alert"
No, it's just time for us to awaken her.

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:20.274
No, it's just time for us to awaken her.

00:03:20.574 --> 00:03:21.634
"Her" who?

00:03:22.344 --> 00:03:24.604
Vein identification, confirmed.

00:03:32.014 --> 00:03:34.414
Retinal identification, confirmed.

00:03:41.394 --> 00:03:43.764
The Children are incredibly good kids!

00:03:46.504 --> 00:03:48.464
Chief, who are you talking about?

00:03:48.464 --> 00:03:51.304
One of the key founders of BABEL.

00:03:51.374 --> 00:03:53.164
She's been sleeping for nearly 10 years.

00:03:53.304 --> 00:03:54.804
Huh? 10 years?!

00:03:54.804 --> 00:03:58.364
Except, this is a bit difficult to explain...

00:04:04.954 --> 00:04:08.224
"Curse you who disturbs my slumber."

00:04:08.224 --> 00:04:10.954
Apparently, there's hell to pay
if you awaken her carelessly.

00:04:11.024 --> 00:04:13.154
But, this time, it's okay.

00:04:13.824 --> 00:04:16.124
You heard her voice before, didn't you?

00:04:17.434 --> 00:04:18.324
Voice?

00:04:22.674 --> 00:04:23.564
Who's there?

00:04:24.274 --> 00:04:26.174
Yes, hello? Mr. Glasses Guy?

00:04:26.244 --> 00:04:27.004
From before!

00:04:27.474 --> 00:04:29.464
Um... It's me, Kiritsubo.

00:04:29.614 --> 00:04:31.074
Can I help you?

00:04:31.074 --> 00:04:32.544
Thanks for your help before.

00:04:32.614 --> 00:04:34.044
The former director left orders to wake you...

00:04:34.044 --> 00:04:35.284
Ugh, I just woke up to use the toilet.
The former director left orders to wake you...

00:04:35.284 --> 00:04:36.914
Ugh, I just woke up to use the toilet.
if the major made any moves, so...

00:04:36.914 --> 00:04:37.414
Wake me up next month.
if the major made any moves, so...

00:04:37.414 --> 00:04:38.474
Wake me up next month.

00:04:38.554 --> 00:04:41.854
Anyway, bye-bye!
Um, even if you say that, I still have to...

00:04:42.284 --> 00:04:43.524
Wait!

00:04:43.524 --> 00:04:45.254
You couldn't wake her up, could you?

00:04:45.254 --> 00:04:48.784
Um, does this person here have
something to do with Major Hyobu?

00:04:48.994 --> 00:04:50.164
Very much so.

00:04:50.164 --> 00:04:52.394
She was his former colleague.

00:04:52.394 --> 00:04:53.634
Colleague?!

00:04:53.634 --> 00:04:55.904
You mean she's over 80 years old?!

00:04:55.904 --> 00:05:00.134
Without her help, capturing and confining
Major Hyobu would have been impossible.

00:05:00.404 --> 00:05:03.044
We have to awaken her at once if
we ever hope to stop PANDRA!

00:05:03.044 --> 00:05:05.374
Shut up! You're keeping me awake!

00:05:05.814 --> 00:05:09.284
She sounds like she's in a pretty bad mood.

00:05:09.284 --> 00:05:11.184
Maybe we should leave for today.

00:05:11.184 --> 00:05:13.154
Warning. Warning.

00:05:13.154 --> 00:05:15.314
Intruders! Intruders!

00:05:15.924 --> 00:05:17.444
Wh-What the?!

00:05:19.394 --> 00:05:20.224
You girls!

00:05:20.564 --> 00:05:21.964
Heh-heh, we tagged along.

00:05:21.964 --> 00:05:23.584
I told you not to, didn't I?!

00:05:23.664 --> 00:05:26.034
But we missed you!

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:28.464
Mr. Minamoto is my destiny!

00:05:28.464 --> 00:05:29.864
Get out of here, now!

00:05:29.934 --> 00:05:33.804
Come on, Minamoto. You missed
us too, didn't you? Well?

00:05:33.874 --> 00:05:35.704
That doesn't matter!

00:05:36.844 --> 00:05:38.074
It doesn't, huh?

00:05:41.284 --> 00:05:42.414
Minamoto!

00:05:42.414 --> 00:05:43.904
Well, you reap what you sow.

00:05:46.424 --> 00:05:47.224
What?

00:05:47.224 --> 00:05:49.154
Ooh! You are such an adorable little man!

00:05:49.224 --> 00:05:51.354
Oh, did you sneak into my bedroom
just to see little old me?

00:05:51.354 --> 00:05:55.294
WHA?! WHAT ARE YOU DOING?!
Wait, are you really 80 years old?!

00:05:55.364 --> 00:05:57.224
I don't like to talk about my age.

00:05:57.294 --> 00:06:00.234
Oh, no! Mr. Minamoto's being
molested by some woman!

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:03.904
Huh?! What are you doing, Minamoto?
Get out here, now!

00:06:03.904 --> 00:06:05.734
No! Wait! Stop!

00:06:15.984 --> 00:06:17.244
Good morning!

00:06:18.854 --> 00:06:20.154
Who's this?

00:06:20.154 --> 00:06:22.554
Y-You're awake, Director Fujiko Tsubomi?

00:06:22.554 --> 00:06:23.954
Yes, wide awake!

00:06:23.954 --> 00:06:26.924
Thank goodness. Well, let's get to HQ at once!

00:06:26.924 --> 00:06:29.524
I'd like some breakfast before that.

00:06:31.934 --> 00:06:32.994
Director!

00:06:35.804 --> 00:06:36.894
Yummy!

00:06:37.104 --> 00:06:38.834
What... the hell?

00:06:39.134 --> 00:06:43.234
I love young guys! Drained so much,
and he's still good to go!

00:06:43.444 --> 00:06:45.274
Hey! How are you still good to go

00:06:45.274 --> 00:06:47.844
after getting sexually harassed by that woman?!

00:06:47.844 --> 00:06:50.144
Um, what's that supposed to mean?

00:06:50.454 --> 00:06:51.244
Dunno.

00:06:51.354 --> 00:06:55.014
Oh, hello! I know all about you girls!

00:06:55.724 --> 00:06:57.984
You and this guy are like "that", right?

00:06:59.124 --> 00:07:00.294
N-No, we're not!

00:07:00.294 --> 00:07:03.224
There's no way we could!
They're still just little kids!

00:07:04.294 --> 00:07:05.734
Little kids?

00:07:09.334 --> 00:07:10.464
What's going on in there?!

00:07:12.004 --> 00:07:14.234
Look out! Naomi!

00:07:15.374 --> 00:07:17.744
I will die as many times as it takes for you!

00:07:19.214 --> 00:07:21.014
You wanna die for me that badly?

00:07:27.854 --> 00:07:29.754
This is terrible!

00:07:30.224 --> 00:07:31.424
Did we get her, Kaoru?

00:07:31.424 --> 00:07:33.124
No, there no resistance.

00:07:35.964 --> 00:07:37.794
Just as you'd expect of a Level 7 psychokinetic.

00:07:40.564 --> 00:07:41.654
Why, you!

00:07:42.234 --> 00:07:44.504
Kaoru, don't! This is!

00:07:47.644 --> 00:07:49.804
Let's be friends, Kaoru Akashi, dear.

00:07:50.874 --> 00:07:52.174
Psychometry?

00:07:54.314 --> 00:07:55.244
Kaoru!

00:08:01.354 --> 00:08:02.614
H-H-Hold it!

00:08:08.524 --> 00:08:09.554
Which leaves...

00:08:11.394 --> 00:08:13.024
Pardon the wait!

00:08:13.764 --> 00:08:16.064
You're not waiting! You aren't waiting at all!

00:08:19.844 --> 00:08:21.274
What happened?!

00:08:21.544 --> 00:08:22.704
Is everyone okay?

00:08:23.944 --> 00:08:26.604
What a yummy-looking dessert!

00:08:27.014 --> 00:08:29.744
NO!!!

00:08:31.414 --> 00:08:33.244
My first kiss...

00:08:33.624 --> 00:08:36.784
And it was from some 80-year-old lady...

00:08:37.124 --> 00:08:39.054
Now I'll never be a bride.

00:08:39.194 --> 00:08:41.054
Mother, I'm sorry...

00:08:41.394 --> 00:08:43.864
Don't be so melodramatic.
I was just saying hello!

00:08:44.094 --> 00:08:45.584
Just a hello.

00:08:46.034 --> 00:08:49.054
Her power is to drain energy via touch.

00:08:49.164 --> 00:08:52.004
Meaning, she's even more
dangerous than Major Hyobu.

00:08:52.134 --> 00:08:54.804
I'm not sure if having her as an ally
is a good thing or a bad thing.

00:08:57.544 --> 00:09:00.114
Are these all the reports filed while I was asleep?

00:09:00.114 --> 00:09:00.844
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:00.844 --> 00:09:03.644
Antagonism between espers and
Normals is growing, huh?

00:09:04.054 --> 00:09:06.574
Fujiko's gonna be busy, huh?

00:09:06.884 --> 00:09:09.874
Please ask us if you need
any more detailed data.

00:09:10.094 --> 00:09:12.494
Well, there's something I'd
like to know immediately.

00:09:12.654 --> 00:09:13.184
Yes?

00:09:14.764 --> 00:09:17.164
Tell me what kind of makeup you're using!

00:09:18.594 --> 00:09:21.224
Makeup must have advanced over
the past 10 years, right?

00:09:22.034 --> 00:09:25.934
This lip gloss has pearl in it.
It makes your lips so shiny!

00:09:26.404 --> 00:09:28.404
Oh, that's adorable!

00:09:28.404 --> 00:09:30.574
And this is super-long lash mascara.

00:09:30.574 --> 00:09:33.064
This color's pretty nice, too!

00:09:34.084 --> 00:09:35.984
Let's do more girl talk later!

00:09:35.984 --> 00:09:36.814
Okay!

00:09:40.284 --> 00:09:42.314
Oh, that was fun.

00:09:42.454 --> 00:09:43.684
Now, then...

00:09:46.324 --> 00:09:47.724
Stupid man...

00:09:47.924 --> 00:09:52.054
Even now, all you do is look at an
unreachable past and future.

00:09:53.364 --> 00:09:56.874
I see. Her age stasis is a secondary effect

00:09:56.874 --> 00:09:59.494
of her energy absorption powers.

00:09:59.774 --> 00:10:04.774
The nature of the ability adds the
energy to her existing powers.

00:10:04.774 --> 00:10:06.044
Those powers being...

00:10:07.014 --> 00:10:07.944
This is!

00:10:07.944 --> 00:10:09.244
Exactly.

00:10:09.584 --> 00:10:11.144
The same as The Childrens'.

00:10:11.314 --> 00:10:12.644
D-Director!

00:10:12.754 --> 00:10:16.654
And under certain conditions,
I can achieve nearly Level 7 power.

00:10:16.794 --> 00:10:20.194
Like a momentary maximum
wind speed in a typhoon.

00:10:20.894 --> 00:10:24.384
By the way, could you call me Fujiko-chan?

00:10:24.564 --> 00:10:25.694
Or Tsubomi, at least.

00:10:25.694 --> 00:10:27.404
I... I couldn't!

00:10:27.404 --> 00:10:30.664
Also... There's one more thing I'd like to discuss.

00:10:33.244 --> 00:10:34.844
My first kiss!

00:10:34.844 --> 00:10:37.864
Just think of it like getting bit by
a dog. Let's forget about it.

00:10:38.114 --> 00:10:40.114
Like I'd forget being bit by a dog?!

00:10:40.114 --> 00:10:43.654
Aoi, you're too girly. It was just a kiss.

00:10:43.654 --> 00:10:46.154
Big illusions about them just make
the real thing disappointing.

00:10:46.154 --> 00:10:49.024
There. Logic from the psychometrist
who thinks she knows about love.

00:10:49.654 --> 00:10:52.224
Shiho, was that really your first time?

00:10:52.224 --> 00:10:54.814
Still, we have to be careful around that woman.

00:10:55.624 --> 00:10:56.764
She looks pretty tough.

00:10:56.764 --> 00:10:59.194
Which is why she keeps teasing us!

00:10:59.194 --> 00:11:00.604
And Minamoto...

00:11:00.604 --> 00:11:01.564
Exactly.

00:11:01.764 --> 00:11:03.464
So, we need to get her trained, fast, right?

00:11:03.904 --> 00:11:05.594
Huh? What did you just say?

00:11:05.904 --> 00:11:11.044
I'm saying, won't you resign as
The Children's supervisor?

00:11:11.044 --> 00:11:13.104
An official order from Fujiko.

00:11:13.884 --> 00:11:15.484
Why would you order that?!

00:11:15.484 --> 00:11:18.154
Out of the blue? For no reason?

00:11:18.154 --> 00:11:19.704
There's a reason.

00:11:19.884 --> 00:11:21.054
At the rate you're going,

00:11:21.054 --> 00:11:24.954
The Children will end up
exactly as Hyobu wants them.

00:11:25.494 --> 00:11:26.594
As Hyobu wants?

00:11:26.594 --> 00:11:28.564
It's too much for you, isn't it?

00:11:29.064 --> 00:11:33.294
You haven't the strength or the
determination to change destiny.

00:11:38.004 --> 00:11:40.804
It's completely afternoon! Let's play outside!

00:11:42.744 --> 00:11:44.934
Soft and shiny lips!

00:11:46.074 --> 00:11:49.484
I don't have the power to change destiny?

00:11:51.054 --> 00:11:52.174
Fate...

00:11:55.154 --> 00:11:57.054
What do you mean?

00:11:57.524 --> 00:12:00.584
Who can say? Fujiko doesn't really know.

00:12:01.364 --> 00:12:04.484
How much does this old lady know?!

00:12:04.834 --> 00:12:08.024
And with that, it's time to for your reassignment!

00:12:09.104 --> 00:12:11.334
W-Wait, please! I!

00:12:11.504 --> 00:12:14.334
A civil servant can't disobey orders!

00:12:19.614 --> 00:12:20.944
Bye-bye!

00:12:21.184 --> 00:12:24.484
Now then, I wonder what changes this will bring.

00:12:26.684 --> 00:12:28.084
This is tyranny!

00:12:29.324 --> 00:12:30.824
Mr. Minamoto's been what?!

00:12:30.824 --> 00:12:31.794
Reassigned?

00:12:33.124 --> 00:12:36.654
Research and Development
suddenly needed him.

00:12:37.094 --> 00:12:39.154
Is that true?

00:12:41.704 --> 00:12:44.434
Shiho, that's against government
service regulations!

00:12:44.434 --> 00:12:48.134
Be honest with us! The old lady did this, right?!

00:12:48.844 --> 00:12:50.464
No violence, either!

00:12:51.014 --> 00:12:54.674
This is your precious
bonsai tree, right, Chief?

00:12:54.944 --> 00:12:56.044
Oops! It slipped.

00:12:56.284 --> 00:12:57.844
No! Stop!

00:12:58.414 --> 00:13:00.244
No threats, either!

00:13:01.054 --> 00:13:02.524
We're not just going along with this!

00:13:02.654 --> 00:13:05.214
Yeah! Mr. Minamoto promised us!

00:13:05.294 --> 00:13:07.224
That he'd stay with us forever.

00:13:07.624 --> 00:13:09.394
I know, I know.

00:13:09.394 --> 00:13:12.494
But the director apparently has other ideas, so...

00:13:14.604 --> 00:13:16.934
Please? Please? Just bear with it for now, okay?

00:13:17.004 --> 00:13:19.434
I promise, I'll eventually do something about it!

00:13:19.434 --> 00:13:21.074
And how long is "eventually"?!

00:13:21.074 --> 00:13:23.814
In any case, deal with it for now!

00:13:23.814 --> 00:13:26.804
The truth is, we have a request
from Precog devision.

00:13:27.944 --> 00:13:28.814
All right.

00:13:28.814 --> 00:13:30.954
But we're taking care of this once we're back!

00:13:30.954 --> 00:13:35.584
Right! Good girls! And do a good
job with your new supervisor!

00:13:35.584 --> 00:13:36.884
New supervisor?

00:13:37.994 --> 00:13:42.394
So, this morning's group training
has borne fruit already!

00:13:44.894 --> 00:13:46.094
So, without further ado...

00:13:46.394 --> 00:13:49.594
Naomi and The Children!

00:13:50.674 --> 00:13:52.134
Released!

00:13:52.134 --> 00:13:54.074
<<RELEASED>>

00:13:56.344 --> 00:13:58.414
Pure, righteous, and wild!

00:13:58.414 --> 00:14:00.274
Absolutely not going along with this!

00:14:00.584 --> 00:14:02.174
Destiny? It feels kind of depressing!

00:14:02.414 --> 00:14:04.314
The future is in the hands of the powerful!

00:14:04.454 --> 00:14:07.074
The honest, upright Wild Cat, and...

00:14:07.384 --> 00:14:08.914
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:14:09.654 --> 00:14:11.994
An oil leak is going to cause a tanker to explode.

00:14:11.994 --> 00:14:14.514
We have more than 30 minutes till the accident.

00:14:14.694 --> 00:14:16.124
Take care of this calmly.

00:14:16.324 --> 00:14:16.984
Yes, sir!

00:14:20.534 --> 00:14:23.504
Doesn't this seem weirdly quiet?

00:14:23.504 --> 00:14:25.934
Yeah. It doesn't feel like anyone's aboard.

00:14:26.704 --> 00:14:29.364
Strange... There's no trace of an oil leak.

00:14:31.674 --> 00:14:32.974
No one's home.

00:14:33.184 --> 00:14:34.734
What's going on?

00:14:35.484 --> 00:14:37.644
Could this be some sort of trap?

00:14:38.114 --> 00:14:39.414
You don't suppose...

00:14:39.414 --> 00:14:41.014
I've been waiting for you!

00:14:45.994 --> 00:14:49.794
Minamoto! What are you doing here?!

00:14:51.864 --> 00:14:52.994
Hey, Minamoto!

00:14:53.734 --> 00:14:55.064
Sakaki...

00:14:55.404 --> 00:14:57.094
What are you doing here?

00:14:57.474 --> 00:15:01.404
I'm a doctor, so I have to show
up in R&D once in a while.

00:15:01.404 --> 00:15:03.444
But I didn't expect to find you here!

00:15:03.444 --> 00:15:04.444
Sakaki!

00:15:04.444 --> 00:15:05.174
Huh?! Hey!

00:15:05.174 --> 00:15:08.344
You have a non-BABEL issued cell phone, right?

00:15:08.344 --> 00:15:09.614
Y-Yeah?

00:15:12.384 --> 00:15:15.444
The number you have dialed is restricted.

00:15:15.624 --> 00:15:18.254
This phone will be automatically destroyed

00:15:18.254 --> 00:15:19.884
under National Security laws.

00:15:22.264 --> 00:15:23.784
Damn. That's no good, either.

00:15:23.964 --> 00:15:26.264
Hey! Why'd you do that?!

00:15:26.264 --> 00:15:28.604
I had a ton of girls' addresses on that thing...

00:15:28.604 --> 00:15:30.224
I can't contact The Children.

00:15:31.504 --> 00:15:33.264
This is all the director's doing.

00:15:33.474 --> 00:15:34.444
Director?

00:15:34.444 --> 00:15:38.474
She's completely separated us!
I can't take this lying down!

00:15:38.474 --> 00:15:41.184
Those girls and I aren't government property!

00:15:41.184 --> 00:15:44.044
Minamoto, I don't know the
details of what's going on,

00:15:47.524 --> 00:15:50.144
but right now, you're being watched.

00:15:51.094 --> 00:15:53.554
Opposing the higher-ups isn't
just gonna get you fired.

00:15:54.024 --> 00:15:58.124
It'll mean arrest... Imprisonment...
Possibly executed, right?

00:16:00.934 --> 00:16:04.804
Come on, you get a nice salary.
Just stay here and be a good boy!

00:16:04.804 --> 00:16:06.364
Yeah, you're right!

00:16:15.044 --> 00:16:16.814
Help me, Minamoto!

00:16:17.554 --> 00:16:19.784
Help me!

00:16:22.284 --> 00:16:23.274
What's?

00:16:23.694 --> 00:16:24.814
Minamoto?

00:16:27.624 --> 00:16:28.664
These images!

00:16:28.664 --> 00:16:31.094
I'm not imagining them or hallucinating, am I?!

00:16:31.094 --> 00:16:33.534
Yeah, they have that kind of power.

00:16:33.964 --> 00:16:37.094
Sending a sense of foreboding
isn't too surprising.

00:16:37.604 --> 00:16:40.834
Has something happened?
I have to go to them, now!

00:16:43.874 --> 00:16:45.574
Sakaki, help me.

00:16:47.644 --> 00:16:51.174
Naomi! Children! Come in! What's happened?!

00:16:55.084 --> 00:16:56.854
It's on fire!

00:16:56.994 --> 00:16:58.324
What on Earth?!

00:16:58.554 --> 00:17:00.594
Are the girls who went in all right?!

00:17:00.594 --> 00:17:03.724
I don't know! Naomi! Children! Come in!

00:17:04.134 --> 00:17:06.184
Please! Answer me!

00:17:11.874 --> 00:17:13.234
Why, you!

00:17:13.234 --> 00:17:17.714
Oh, why so mad? I thought you'd be happy.

00:17:17.714 --> 00:17:21.244
Get real! So, you are the enemy, aren't you?!

00:17:21.244 --> 00:17:22.614
EAT THIS!

00:17:34.594 --> 00:17:35.784
Kaoru!

00:17:36.264 --> 00:17:37.454
How dare you!

00:17:39.764 --> 00:17:41.664
Don't underestimate us!

00:17:47.244 --> 00:17:48.294
Still want to fight?

00:17:48.844 --> 00:17:50.074
Darn it!

00:17:50.074 --> 00:17:55.074
Oh, don't look so mad!
I'm doing this for your sake.

00:17:55.444 --> 00:17:56.884
Are you teasing us?!

00:17:56.884 --> 00:18:02.324
Oh, well. Then I'll tell you something
that'll prove I'm on your side.

00:18:02.454 --> 00:18:05.214
Minamoto is on his way here right now!

00:18:06.694 --> 00:18:08.524
Hey! Do what I say!

00:18:09.824 --> 00:18:12.324
Otherwise, I'll kill him!

00:18:14.834 --> 00:18:16.234
Save me!

00:18:16.504 --> 00:18:20.204
He's willing to disobey orders to save you girls.

00:18:20.344 --> 00:18:21.804
Is that true?

00:18:21.804 --> 00:18:25.674
Yes. His heart nearly broke from
worrying about you girls.

00:18:26.214 --> 00:18:29.404
But don't you think there's a problem here?

00:18:29.584 --> 00:18:30.414
Problem?

00:18:30.714 --> 00:18:33.684
In the end, The Children
are simply children to him.

00:18:33.684 --> 00:18:35.154
Like little sisters.

00:18:35.554 --> 00:18:38.424
Of course, in a few years, he may realize it.

00:18:39.024 --> 00:18:41.894
That you all have grown into lovely women.

00:18:42.424 --> 00:18:44.394
But then, it'll be too late.

00:18:48.604 --> 00:18:49.494
Where is everyone?!

00:18:51.604 --> 00:18:52.794
Snap out of it!

00:18:53.604 --> 00:18:54.694
Minamoto...

00:18:55.774 --> 00:18:57.144
Mr. Minamoto...

00:18:58.914 --> 00:19:00.244
Mr. Minamoto...

00:19:00.414 --> 00:19:02.644
I... I'm not gonna make it...

00:19:02.714 --> 00:19:05.254
That can't be! I'll get you to the hospital now!

00:19:05.254 --> 00:19:07.924
No, just hug us, like you're doing now...

00:19:07.924 --> 00:19:11.254
Like a lover... Please! Just for now...

00:19:12.224 --> 00:19:13.744
Not just for now.

00:19:13.894 --> 00:19:17.094
We've been that... And we always will be...

00:19:17.434 --> 00:19:18.534
Minamoto!

00:19:18.534 --> 00:19:19.624
Mr. Minamoto...

00:19:19.894 --> 00:19:20.764
Mr. Minamoto...

00:19:21.504 --> 00:19:23.264
I've been a fool.

00:19:23.264 --> 00:19:25.824
Only now, when I'm about to lose you, do I see.

00:19:26.334 --> 00:19:29.304
I love you... As women.

00:19:32.114 --> 00:19:35.084
Um, hold it. Don't you think that's a little much?

00:19:35.084 --> 00:19:36.744
Not at all!

00:19:39.154 --> 00:19:41.744
NAOMI!

00:19:42.884 --> 00:19:44.854
My Naomi!

00:19:44.854 --> 00:19:47.124
Only now, when I was about
to lose you, do I see!

00:19:47.124 --> 00:19:49.494
I love you! As a woman!

00:19:49.494 --> 00:19:51.394
Je t'aime!

00:19:51.634 --> 00:19:52.394
See?

00:19:53.504 --> 00:19:55.604
He's an exception! AN EXCEPTION!

00:19:55.604 --> 00:19:57.124
There you go.

00:19:57.474 --> 00:20:00.064
Things will absolutely work out. Good luck!

00:20:00.374 --> 00:20:02.104
Okay!

00:20:08.784 --> 00:20:10.044
Director Tsubomi!

00:20:10.254 --> 00:20:11.714
What do you think you're doing?

00:20:11.784 --> 00:20:14.344
Disobeying Fujiko's orders and coming here?!

00:20:15.724 --> 00:20:19.054
I want you to tell me exactly
what your feelings are!

00:20:19.254 --> 00:20:23.194
My relationship with The Children
isn't just a professional one!

00:20:23.764 --> 00:20:25.994
What you need right now

00:20:25.994 --> 00:20:29.264
is a love so strong it'll let you change destiny.

00:20:29.504 --> 00:20:33.434
And no order is going to keep us apart!

00:20:34.644 --> 00:20:35.194
I see.

00:20:36.404 --> 00:20:40.074
It may be small, but if that
seed is there, I'll nurture it.

00:20:40.514 --> 00:20:41.084
But the problem here is those girls.

00:20:41.084 --> 00:20:43.344
GALLEY
But the problem here is those girls.

00:20:43.344 --> 00:20:43.384
GALLEY

00:20:43.384 --> 00:20:44.444
TOMATO SAUCE

00:20:50.254 --> 00:20:51.744
Maybe it needs to be more realistic.

00:20:53.394 --> 00:20:54.414
G-Girls!

00:20:56.064 --> 00:20:57.394
What are you doing?

00:20:57.834 --> 00:20:58.634
Huh?

00:20:58.634 --> 00:20:59.724
You're already here?

00:20:59.794 --> 00:21:01.094
I'm not finished!

00:21:01.504 --> 00:21:04.264
Man... They're such kids!

00:21:04.734 --> 00:21:06.074
Minamoto...

00:21:06.074 --> 00:21:08.604
My examination has revealed that The Children

00:21:08.604 --> 00:21:10.074
don't have a scratch on them!

00:21:10.814 --> 00:21:11.774
Sorry.

00:21:11.774 --> 00:21:13.814
But it's good that we're okay, right?

00:21:13.814 --> 00:21:15.644
Yes! Thank goodness!

00:21:15.644 --> 00:21:17.184
A happy ending!

00:21:17.184 --> 00:21:20.514
Meaning I ended up getting
played by EVERYBODY!

00:21:21.184 --> 00:21:23.994
No, I was only following orders!

00:21:23.994 --> 00:21:25.954
Minamoto, don't be so mad!

00:21:25.954 --> 00:21:27.864
It was your fault, too, Mr. Minamoto.

00:21:27.864 --> 00:21:31.194
Yeah, the way you always say we're little kids.

00:21:31.494 --> 00:21:33.134
But we forgive you.

00:21:33.134 --> 00:21:34.834
We're even, now.

00:21:34.834 --> 00:21:36.804
Right, so let's just put this
whole thing behind us.

00:21:36.804 --> 00:21:38.134
Don't be ridiculous!

00:21:38.134 --> 00:21:40.574
What were you doing in the middle
of an important mission?!

00:21:40.574 --> 00:21:44.114
And you were having fun by making me worry?!

00:21:44.114 --> 00:21:45.314
What do you think of me...

00:21:45.314 --> 00:21:48.084
I mean, what do you think of this job?!

00:21:48.084 --> 00:21:50.644
If you want to do that, then find
yourself a new supervisor!

00:21:51.654 --> 00:21:53.354
Huh? Hey, Minamoto!

00:21:53.354 --> 00:21:57.844
Let go! I've had enough! Screw this job! I quit!

00:21:59.024 --> 00:22:01.864
Minamoto, I know how you feel, but!

00:22:01.864 --> 00:22:03.934
Just let the director explain!

00:22:03.934 --> 00:22:05.524
Mr. Minamoto!

00:22:21.314 --> 00:22:26.054
Kimi no tsuyogari wo gyuuto dakishimeta

00:22:26.054 --> 00:22:28.984
Setsunai yokogao sae zenbu

00:22:28.984 --> 00:22:31.354
I-TO-SHI-I

00:22:31.354 --> 00:22:35.564
Kabe wo kowasu tabi tsuyokunaru onna yo

00:22:35.564 --> 00:22:41.434
Boku no hitomi ni kurui wa nai

00:22:41.734 --> 00:22:46.734
Massugu sugiru mune no omoi

00:22:46.734 --> 00:22:50.274
Darenimo makenai kara

00:22:50.274 --> 00:22:55.544
Zettai kimi wo hanasanai donna toki mo

00:22:55.544 --> 00:23:00.754
Mada mienai LAST wa boku ga kaeyou

00:23:00.754 --> 00:23:05.094
Akuma mo tenshi nimo tsubasa ga aru

00:23:05.094 --> 00:23:10.734
Motto takai sora e to michibikou

00:23:10.734 --> 00:23:15.434
Kore ijou egao wo kumorasenai

00:23:15.434 --> 00:23:21.804
Tsunagaru kibou ga ima yami wo hikisaitara

00:23:21.804 --> 00:23:24.744
Kimi to tomo ni

00:23:24.974 --> 00:23:30.604
Tobikoeru ashita e Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.924 --> 00:23:41.024
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.024 --> 00:23:41.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.894 --> 00:23:43.194
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.194 --> 00:23:44.594
Where are we?

00:23:44.594 --> 00:23:46.584
This sea was a place Igo loved.

00:23:46.664 --> 00:23:47.364
Igo?

00:23:47.364 --> 00:23:49.134
I hope he's all right.

00:23:49.134 --> 00:23:53.604
Because it would prove that a sad
future isn't an absolute certainty.

00:23:53.604 --> 00:23:55.744
You know everything, don't you?

00:23:55.744 --> 00:23:57.374
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.374 --> 00:24:01.084
Episode 29: "The Art of Coaxing!
The Closest Sea to Heaven"

00:24:01.084 --> 00:24:03.204
How do you do? I'm Hanae Suetsuma!

00:24:03.284 --> 00:24:05.714
All right, could you go on
and brainwash him for me?

00:24:05.714 --> 00:24:06.814
WHAT?!

00:24:06.814 --> 00:24:08.224
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.224 --> 00:24:09.054
The Art of Coaxing!
The Closest Sea to Heaven
